\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {18}{\ignorespaces Spine peak versus an optional last-line decode stop, $n{=}32$, $\mathrm  {tp}{=}2$. \textsf  {PD-Prune+}is the prefill admission stack on the aliased trunk: hash skip, draft prune, residual-prefix abort, and the connector gate. It keeps the same spine as the alias row and does not stop decode. This slice also ends committed decode when the last non-empty line is a finished answer; that processor is separate, and it is what moves accuracy and $D^{+}$. Peak is the max over chunks. GSM8K $D{=}512$; Game24 $D{=}256$. R1-8B is DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B; L8B is Llama-3-8B; M7B is Mistral-7B. Best storage in green.}}{24}{table.caption.66}\protected@file@percent }
